    {
      "id": "5ndlqZMVrz5q1DMEaId5f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 635.1747538942594,
      "y": 8276.5777800795,
      "width": 700.6995239257812,
      "height": 302.40000000000003,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6i",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1935430479,
      "version": 84,
      "versionNonce": 820909967,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1747354729964,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirement\n1. Set preference (age, gender, etc)\n2. See candidates base on preference (close to location)\n3. Like(right) or Not(left) candidate\n4. Match if liked each other, receive notification\n5. Create profile\n\nAvoid showing repeat profile",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirement\n1. Set preference (age, gender, etc)\n2. See candidates base on preference (close to location)\n3. Like(right) or Not(left) candidate\n4. Match if liked each other, receive notification\n5. Create profile\n\nAvoid showing repeat profile",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "ddDysYYvWoM2_yiST4ZvP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 633.9844949285778,
      "y": 8663.06359518954,
      "width": 898.0433959960938,
      "height": 378.00000000000006,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b6k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1853696161,
      "version": 644,
      "versionNonce": 114086921,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1747784332924,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-functional Requirement\n\nConsistency\n- swipe, if a person liked a person, match immediately.\n   the other person get notification immediately.\n\nAvailability\n- candidates low latency loading (<300ms to load matched candidates)\n\nHeavy Write > read for swipe",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-functional Requirement\n\nConsistency\n- swipe, if a person liked a person, match immediately.\n   the other person get notification immediately.\n\nAvailability\n- candidates low latency loading (<300ms to load matched candidates)\n\nHeavy Write > read for swipe",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
    {
      "id": "9mY9FKBFvD25N4FZ_x5RO",
